Package: howbig
Title: Empirical, Method-Aware Power Analysis for Differential Network Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Margie", "Hannum", email = "margie.hannum@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sample-size and power calculations for differential network
    analysis, grounded in a precomputed simulation grid across sample size,
    feature count, perturbation type, and estimation method. Given a target
    power (sensitivity at a false-discovery-rate target), howbig looks up or
    interpolates the required sample size from the grid, and flags every
    answer with how it was produced (in-grid, interpolated, or requiring
    simulation). A network-native, method-aware analogue to 'pwr'.
